;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;margin:0pt 0pt 2pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:9pt;margin-bottom:0pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:33.32%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="position:absolute;top:0pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;margin:0pt 0pt 2pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:9pt;margin-bottom:0pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td></tr><tr style=""><td style="vertical-align:top;width:33.33%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:9pt;line-height:1.19;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 2pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Title of Each Class</b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:33.33%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:9pt;line-height:1.19;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 2pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Name of Exchange on Which Registered</b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:33.32%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:9pt;line-height:1.19;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 2pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Trading Symbol</b></p></td></tr><tr style=""><td style="vertical-align:top;width:33.33%;border-top:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_Bkg6Nnz14EaLX13yikDEcQ" name="dei:Security12bTitle" id="Tc_ouZ3SIEwRUqVyho-D2lM6w_2_0"><b style="font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;">Common Stock, $0.01 par value</b></ix:nonNumeric></p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:33.33%;border-top:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;">The </b><ix:nonNumeric format="ixt-sec:exchnameen" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_Bkg6Nnz14EaLX13yikDEcQ" name="dei:SecurityExchangeName" id="Narr_wDhv6L7sUkKw4qSwEQgs6Q"><b style="font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;">NASDAQ</b></ix:nonNumeric><b style="font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;"> Stock Market</b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:33.32%;border-top:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_Bkg6Nnz14EaLX13yikDEcQ" name="dei:TradingSymbol" id="Tc_dUuy5r6Ywkm3sJAaboVbYw_2_2"><span style="font-size:9pt;">DWSN</span></ix:nonNumeric></p></td></tr></table><div style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:9.0pt;margin-bottom:2pt;margin-top:2pt;min-height:1.19em;position:relative;width:100%;"><div style="background-color:#000000;height:1pt;position:relative;top:0.6em;width:25.0%;border:none;margin:0 auto;"></div></div><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-indent:21.6pt;margin:0pt 0pt 4pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:9pt;">Indicate by check mark whether the registrant: (1)&#160;has filed all reports required to be filed by Section&#160;13 or 15(d)&#160;of the Securities Exchange Act of 1934 during the preceding 12 months (or for such shorter period that the Registrant was required to file such reports), and (2)&#160;</span><span style="font-size:9pt;white-space:pre-wrap;">has been subject to such filing requirements for the past 90 days.  </span><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_Bkg6Nnz14EaLX13yikDEcQ" name="dei:EntityCurrentReportingStatus" id="Narr_Aymowz3Sqk-pCAkG7bgCiw"><span style="font-size:9pt;">Yes</span></ix:nonNumeric><span style="font-size:9pt;">&#160;</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:9pt;">&#8999;</span><span style="font-size:9pt;">&#160;&#160;No </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:9pt;">&#9723;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-indent:21.6pt;margin:0pt 0pt 4pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:9pt;">Indicate by check mark whether the registrant has submitted electronically every Interactive Data File required to be submitted pursuant to Rule&#160;</span><span style="font-size:9pt;white-space:pre-wrap;">405 of Regulation S-T (&#167;232.405 of this chapter) during the preceding 12 months (or for such shorter period that the registrant was required to submit such files).  </span><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_Bkg6Nnz14EaLX13yikDEcQ" name="dei:EntityInteractiveDataCurrent" id="Narr_UGmepSWqT0qmdqdXXe6EwA"><span style="font-size:9pt;">Yes</span></ix:nonNumeric><span style="font-size:9pt;">&#160;</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:9pt;">&#8999;</span><span style="font-size:9pt;">&#160;&#160;No </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:9pt;">&#9723;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:9pt;line-height:1.19;text-indent:21.6pt;margin:0pt 0pt 4pt 0pt;">Indicate by check mark whether the registrant is a large accelerated filer, an accelerated filer, a non-accelerated filer, a smaller reporting company, or an emerging growth company. See the definitions of &#8220;large accelerated filer,&#8221; &#8220;accelerated filer,&#8221; &#8220;smaller reporting company,&#8221; and &#8220;emerging growth company&#8221; in Rule 12b-2 of the Exchange Act.</p>